B.aNc=s(["Prepare a clean space and place a small bowl of water as a symbol of the Nile and renewal.","Study Hapi and the importance of the Nile inundation to agricultural abundance.","Reflect on Ma\u2019at: prosperity should be pursued through fair dealing and responsibility.","Name a resource you can steward more wisely.","Write one concrete action toward sustainable prosperity.","Close with gratitude for the resources that support life."],t.s)
B.aQ_=s(["Prepare a peaceful space and consider the symbolism of Hathor.","Reflect on Hathor as a goddess associated with music, celebration, affection, and joy.","Consider how mutual respect and honest communication sustain relationships.","Write down one quality you wish to cultivate in your relationships.","Choose one respectful action that expresses care without attempting to control another person.","Close with appreciation for companionship and community."],t.s)
B.aQf=s(["Observe the current Moon phase if it is visible, or consult the lunar calendar.","Study Khonsu and Thoth in relation to lunar symbolism and timekeeping.","Reflect on how ancient Egyptian calendars organized religious and seasonal life.","Choose a personal intention appropriate to your present circumstances.","Record a practical step toward that intention.","Close by acknowledging change and the passage of time."],t.s)
B.aOJ=s(["Prepare a journal before sleeping or reviewing a recent dream.","Consider the documented importance of dreams and their interpretation in ancient Egypt.","Reflect on the relationship between Thoth, writing, and knowledge.","Record the dream carefully without assuming every symbol predicts an event.","Identify possible personal meanings and distinguish them from historical interpretations.","Close with a question for further reflection rather than a claim of certainty."],t.s)
B.aQ4=s(["Prepare a respectful remembrance space with a meaningful keepsake if available.","Study Egyptian remembrance traditions and the concept of the akh.","Recall a person whose actions or teachings influenced your life.","Speak or write their name if you wish.","Consider a value worth carrying into your own actions.","Close with a moment of gratitude and remembrance."],t.s)
