B.aS_=new A.c5([0,"FontWeight.w100",1,"FontWeight.w200",2,"FontWeight.w300",3,"FontWeight.w400",4,"FontWeight.w500",5,"FontWeight.w600",6,"FontWeight.w700",7,"FontWeight.w800",8,"FontWeight.w900"],t.TM)
B.i1={prosperity:0,love:1,protection:2,lunar:3,dreams:4,ancestors:5}
B.aS0=new A.bD(B.i1,["What resource can I manage more wisely, and what specific step will I take?","What relationship would benefit from more honesty, care, or a clearer boundary?","What concern deserves attention, and what realistic action can I take?","What intention matters most right now, and what is my next practical step?","What details and emotions stood out, and what possible meanings can I explore?","Whom did I remember, what did I learn from them, and how can I honor that lesson?"],t.l)
B.aS1=new A.bD(B.i1,["Reflect on resources, responsible choices, and one practical step toward greater stability.","Cultivate respect, honest communication, compassion, and healthy relationships.","Reflect on personal boundaries, safety, clarity, and realistic protective actions.","Use lunar symbolism as a framework for reflection, personal intentions, and meaningful action.","Record dream details, explore personal associations, and distinguish reflection from prediction.","Remember people who shaped your life and identify values worth carrying forward."],t.l)
B.aS2=new A.bD(B.i1,["May I use my resources wisely and build stability through responsible action.","May I act with compassion, honesty, reciprocity, and respect for every person.","May I meet challenges with clear judgment, healthy boundaries, and practical care.","May I accept change with patience and turn thoughtful intentions into action.","May I approach dreams with curiosity, discernment, and an open mind.","May I honor those who came before me by carrying forward the lessons that serve life."],t.l)
B.aS3=new A.bD(B.i1,["Prosperity and Responsible Stewardship","Love, Reciprocity, and Respect","Protection, Boundaries, and Clarity","Lunar Reflection and Intention Setting","Dream Reflection and Symbol Journaling","Ancestral Remembrance and Gratitude"],t.l)
B.aJA=s(["Prepare a quiet space and consider the Five Phases as a framework of changing relationships.","Reflect on how resources circulate through work, community, and nature.","Consider the importance of moderation and responsible stewardship.","Identify one financial or practical responsibility requiring attention.","Choose a concrete action that supports sustainable well-being.","Close with gratitude rather than promises of supernatural wealth."],t.s)
B.aOX=s(["Prepare a calm space for reflection on relationships.","Consider the Confucian concepts of ren, humaneness, and li, appropriate conduct.","Reflect on reciprocity, trust, and responsibility in relationships.","Identify a relationship where clearer communication may help.","Choose one respectful action without attempting to control another person.","Close by considering how your conduct contributes to harmony."],t.s)
B.aOD=s(["Prepare a clean and orderly space as a modern symbolic purification.","Study the historical diversity of Daoist purification and protective traditions.","Consider the importance of ethical conduct and personal boundaries.","Name a practical safety concern that deserves attention.","Choose one realistic protective action you can take.","Close with a moment of calm and clarity."],t.s)
B.aPS=s(["Consult the current lunar date or observe the Moon when visible.","Reflect on the relationship between lunar months and seasonal observances in Chinese calendrical traditions.","Consider how cycles of change appear in the Yijing and classical cosmology.","Record an intention suited to your present season of life.","Choose one practical action aligned with that intention.","Close by acknowledging change and continuity."],t.s)
B.aOj=s(["Prepare a journal and record a recent dream as accurately as possible.","Consider the butterfly dream in the Zhuangzi as a philosophical reflection on perception.","Distinguish philosophical interpretation from claims of supernatural prediction.","Reflect on the emotions and questions raised by the dream.","Write one insight worth examining in waking life.","Close without treating the dream as certain evidence of future events."],t.s)
B.aKs=s(["Prepare a respectful space with a photograph or keepsake if desired.","Reflect on the long history of ancestral veneration in Chinese traditions.","Recall a person whose teachings or actions shaped your life.","Express remembrance through words, writing, or a symbolic gesture.","Consider a responsibility or value you wish to carry forward.","Close with gratitude and respect."],t.s)
