B.JN={"Money & Prosperity":0,"Love & Relationships":1,"Protection & Cleansing":2,"Moon & Manifestation":3,"Dreams & Intuition":4,"Ancestors & Remembrance":5}
B.aSe=new A.bD(B.JN,["prosperity","love","protection","lunar","dreams","ancestors"],t.l)
B.azv=s(["Ancient Egyptian Prosperity and Responsible Stewardship","Jade","Attract prosperity and abundance while giving sincere gratitude to the Creator of the Universe for everything already provided.","SACRED LETTER OF PROSPERITY AND GRATITUDE","Creator of the Universe, source of all life, abundance, wisdom, and creation, I come before you with an open heart and a grateful spirit.\n\nBefore I ask for anything, I give thanks for everything I have already received. Thank you for the breath within my body, the life I have been given, the opportunities before me, and the blessings I may not always recognize.\n\nI honor Ra, the sacred Sun whose light nourishes the Earth and sustains life. I honor Thoth, associated with the Moon, wisdom, knowledge, and sacred writing.\n\nBeneath this sacred Moon, I open my life to prosperity, abundance, financial stability, and honorable opportunities.\n\nMay the work of my hands be fruitful. May my efforts bring meaningful rewards. May opportunities for growth and success enter my life.\n\nGrant me the wisdom to recognize opportunity, the discipline to manage what I receive, and the understanding to use prosperity responsibly.\n\nMay abundance flow into my life through honest work, wise decisions, and paths that bring harm to none.\n\nI give thanks for what I have, for what I am building, and for the blessings that may come.\n\nAs I release these words into the universe, I do so with gratitude, faith, and a heart prepared to receive."],t.s)
B.aNa=s(["Ancient Egyptian Love and Relationships","Rose Quartz","Welcome genuine love, compassion, healthy relationships, and gratitude for the love already present.","SACRED LETTER OF LOVE AND HARMONY","Creator of the Universe, source of life, compassion, and the love that connects all creation, I come before you with gratitude and an open heart.\n\nThank you for the love I have experienced, the kindness I have received, the lessons I have learned, and the people whose presence has enriched my journey.\n\nI honor Ra, whose sunlight brings warmth and life to the Earth. I honor Thoth, associated with the Moon, wisdom, understanding, and sacred knowledge.\n\nBeneath this sacred Moon, I welcome genuine love, peace, compassion, and harmony into my life.\n\nMay my heart attract relationships founded upon honesty, loyalty, respect, understanding, and kindness.\n\nMay the love I give be sincere, and may the love I receive be freely given.\n\nGuide my words toward patience, my actions toward compassion, and my heart toward forgiveness where forgiveness is healthy and deserved.\n\nMay I recognize relationships that bring peace and growth, and may I have the wisdom to establish boundaries where they are needed.\n\nI give thanks for the love already surrounding me and welcome new opportunities for meaningful connection.\n\nAs I release these words into the universe, may love and harmony continue to grow within me and around me."],t.s)
B.aNt=s(["Ancient Egyptian Protection and Cleansing","Tiger's Eye and Amethyst","Invite peace, protection, clarity, and positive energy while releasing harmful intentions without wishing harm on others.","SACRED LETTER OF PROTECTION AND PEACE","Creator of the Universe, source of life, truth, wisdom, and sacred order, I come before you with gratitude for the protection and guidance I have received.\n\nThank you for carrying me through challenges, for the strength to overcome difficulties, and for the wisdom gained through my experiences.\n\nI honor Ra, whose light illuminates the Earth and brings life to creation. I honor Thoth, associated with the Moon, wisdom, understanding, and discernment.\n\nBeneath this sacred Moon, I ask that my life be surrounded by peace, protection, clarity, and positive energy.\n\nMay my home, my loved ones, my mind, and my spirit remain guided toward safety and harmony.\n\nMay harmful intentions, jealousy, hostility, and negativity directed toward me find no place to take root in my life.\n\nWhatever ill will is sent toward me, I release it from my path and return it to its source without wishing suffering or injury upon anyone.\n\nMay every harmful intention be transformed into an opportunity for understanding, accountability, and peace.\n\nGrant me courage when I face difficulty, wisdom when I must make decisions, and discernment to recognize what does not serve my well-being.\n\nI welcome peace where there has been unrest, clarity where there has been confusion, and strength where there has been uncertainty.\n\nI give thanks for the protection already present in my life and for the wisdom to take practical steps to keep myself and others safe.\n\nAs I release these words into the universe, I welcome protection, harmony, and positive energy."],t.s)
B.aCN=s(["Ancient Egyptian Moon and Manifestation","Moonstone","Welcome growth, renewal, opportunity, and positive transformation with gratitude and purposeful action.","SACRED LETTER OF MANIFESTATION AND NEW BEGINNINGS","Creator of the Universe, source of the Sun, Moon, stars, Earth, and all existence, I come before you with gratitude for the gift of life and the possibilities within creation.\n\nThank you for every new beginning, every opportunity to learn, and every moment that allows me to grow into a wiser and stronger person.\n\nI honor Ra, whose sunlight renews the Earth with each passing day. I honor Thoth, associated with the Moon, wisdom, knowledge, and the sacred cycles of time.\n\nBeneath this sacred Moon, I establish my intention to welcome growth, opportunity, renewal, and positive transformation into my life.\n\nMay my thoughts become clear, my decisions purposeful, and my actions aligned with the future I seek to create.\n\nMay doors of opportunity open through preparation, perseverance, and honorable effort.\n\nMay I recognize the possibilities before me and have the courage to act when the time is right.\n\nAs the Moon moves through its phases, may I understand that growth requires patience, change requires courage, and meaningful accomplishments require dedication.\n\nI release unnecessary doubt and welcome confidence, understanding, and renewed purpose.\n\nI give thanks for what has already unfolded in my life and for the possibilities that remain ahead.\n\nAs I release these words into the universe, I welcome a new chapter of growth and fulfillment."],t.s)
B.aGf=s(["Ancient Egyptian Dreams and Intuition","Amethyst","Seek peaceful rest, clarity, insight, and gratitude for wisdom gained through dreams and reflection.","SACRED LETTER OF DREAMS AND INNER WISDOM","Creator of the Universe, source of life, knowledge, wisdom, and understanding, I come before you with a peaceful heart and a grateful spirit.\n\nThank you for the gift of thought, the ability to learn, the power of reflection, and the mysteries of life that inspire curiosity and understanding.\n\nI honor Ra, whose sunlight illuminates the waking world. I honor Thoth, associated with the Moon, sacred writing, knowledge, and wisdom.\n\nBeneath this sacred Moon, I seek peace within my mind, clarity within my thoughts, and greater understanding of my dreams and personal experiences.\n\nMay my rest be peaceful and my dreams offer opportunities for reflection, creativity, and insight.\n\nMay I recognize the lessons that arise from my experiences without allowing fear or confusion to guide my decisions.\n\nStrengthen my patience, deepen my self-awareness, and help me distinguish thoughtful intuition from worry and uncertainty.\n\nMay wisdom guide my interpretation of what I experience, and may truth remain the foundation of my understanding.\n\nI welcome calm, peaceful rest, thoughtful reflection, and the courage to learn more about myself.\n\nI give thanks for the knowledge I have gained and the understanding I have yet to discover.\n\nAs I release these words into the universe, I welcome wisdom, clarity, and peace."],t.s)
B.axf=s(["Ancient Egyptian Ancestors and Remembrance","Black Onyx","Express gratitude for ancestors and earlier generations, preserve wisdom, and welcome a peaceful legacy.","SACRED LETTER OF ANCESTRAL GRATITUDE AND REMEMBRANCE","Creator of the Universe, source of life throughout all generations, I come before you with humility, gratitude, and respect for those who walked the Earth before me.\n\nThank you for the gift of life, for the generations whose existence made my own possible, and for the wisdom and experiences passed down through time.\n\nI honor Ra, whose sunlight has illuminated the Earth across countless generations. I honor Thoth, associated with the Moon, wisdom, sacred writing, and the preservation of knowledge.\n\nBeneath this sacred Moon, I pause to honor my ancestors, my family history, and the lives of those who came before me.\n\nMay the memories of those who lived before me inspire gratitude, understanding, compassion, and strength.\n\nMay I preserve the wisdom that deserves to be remembered and learn from the hardships and mistakes of earlier generations.\n\nMay I carry forward what is honorable, build upon what is good, and create a legacy of dignity, kindness, and responsible action.\n\nI give thanks for the sacrifices made, the lessons learned, and the opportunities I have inherited.\n\nMay the generations that follow receive greater understanding, peace, and opportunity through the choices I make today.\n\nAs I release these words into the universe, I honor the past, give thanks for the present, and welcome a future guided by wisdom."],t.s)
B.aSf=new A.bD(B.JN,[B.azv,B.aNa,B.aNt,B.aCN,B.aGf,B.axf],t.VJ)
